    - Per-state handler functions with exhaustive when expressions
    - W3C SCXML 3.13: Ancestor transition routing (child -> parent -> grandparent)
    - Three-way condition pattern: In() predicate | safeEvaluateGuard() | static Kotlin
    - History state target resolution (W3C SCXML 3.11)
    - Multi-descriptor event matching (W3C SCXML 3.12.1)
#}
